window.products.push({"id":284150,"name":"AZAMIA Stretch Sofa Slipcover (78\"-95\") for 3 Cushion Sofa, Oversized Water-Repellent Non-Slip Couch Sofa Cover Furniture Cover with Non-Skid Foam and","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e2q-RnOjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"😊HIGH STRETCHY & WATER-REPELLENT: AZAMIA Sofa Slipcover is made of 85% polyester 15% spandex fabric, which is soft in texture, comfortable in feeling and with good breathability. Improved thick cloth is more durable and wear resistant. This soft textured stretch sofa cover is made of Water-Repellent fabric (NOT Waterproof), protecting your sofa to a certain extent, but spills should be removed quickly!💚 Summer is coming, thinner fabric is more suitable for summer use. 😊TRANSFORM YOUR OLD SOFA & PROTECT YOUR NEW SOFA: AZAMIA Sofa Furniture Protectors prevent your furniture from spills, stains and tearing of everyday living. Save you money by extending the life of your sofa. A great choice for homes with children and pets. ＊Please note that a certain color difference between the real object and the picture is inevitable. 💚The OLIVE YELLOW sofa cover will look a little bit GREEN, Buy carefully if you mind. 😊OVERSIZED NONSLIP SOFA SLIPCOVER: The size of AZAMIA Sofa Slipcover is 78-95inch, which is perfect for 3 cushion couch. Our universal oversized couch cover is large enough for your sofa of various size, it can cover the back of your sofa, providing all-round protection. This sofa cover sewn with thick elastic loops on bottom to cover the base edges, bonus enough foam sticks for keeping the covers in place firmly, high recommended for both leather and cloth sofas. 😊EASY TO INSTALL & MAINTAIN: You'll be done in no time! Just slip it on, Tuck any extra fabric and insert the non slip foam anchors into the gap/crease between the back and sitting cushions. Please refer to the Installation Instructions. This sofa cover is machine washable, please wash it at temperature around 30 degrees Celsius, mild laundry detergents are advised. 💚Hair will stick to the sofa cover, so roller type cleaner is a good helper for cleaning dirt and hair on the sofa cover. 😊AZAMIA RISK-FREE PURCHASE: AZAMIA Sofa Slipcover provides full protection to your sofa and create a bright new environment to your room. If you have any question with the purchase for any reason, don’t hesitate to contact us, we will provide 100% money back guarantees or free replacement service. Enjoy this absolutely RISK FREE purchase today by clicking the yellow 'Add to Cart button' above.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e2q-RnOjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AZAMIA","source_asin":"B08MVDZC2Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-284150","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MVDZC2Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MVDZC2Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
