window.products.push({"id":284170,"name":"Joroamp Fireplace Carrier Waxed Firewood Canvas Log Carrier Tote Bag Outdoor Log Tote Large Wood Carrying Bag with Handles Security Strap Camping Indo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612yOG7S+vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌳【Carry More Firewood】:Large carrier bag with extra large dimensions of 39\" Long x 18\" Wide, excellent size for carrying more logs, firewood, kindling, woods and twigs. It can easily hold a dozen logs or 50 pounds. This canvas log carrier for firewood has open sides, so you can load it up with any length of firewood. It can save you a lot of boring time hauling firewood, giving you more time to enjoy camping. 🌳【Heavy Duty Canvas Firewood Carrier Bag】:The waxed canvas material repels water, so you can carry in snowy logs without getting wet.The canvas fabric is extremely durable and you don't have to worry about it being scratched by rough wood.The handle of the nylon cord is also very tenacious, enough to carry the weight of the wood, completely don't worry it will break. 🌳【Humanized Design】: Featuring an adjustable central strap for securing and tightening the wood logs while loaded. It will keep the bundle neat and tight inside the canvas wood carrier. The reinforced padded handles make it comfortable to haul in wood without slipping or having your hands and palms pay the price of splinters. 🌳【 Indoor & Outdoor 】: Firewood carrier bag use to holder the woods for grilling, fire pit, and outdoor camping. Keeps dirt and wood chips off you and your floors! The curved shape of the wood bag can keep sawdust, dirt and wood chips in the log bag instead of spilling out for less mess. 🌳【Customer Care】: We are dedicated to provide premium products for you and offer impeccable customer care to you. Don’t wait any longer and just enjoy your ideal products today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612yOG7S+vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joroamp","source_asin":"B08K2KH8D8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-284170","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K2KH8D8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K2KH8D8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
