window.products.push({"id":284230,"name":"Yescool Sherpa Weighted Blanket Twin Size for Adults (48x72 inch, 15 lbs), Soft Fuzzy Fleece Weighted Blanket, Cozy Plush Heavy Blanket Throw for Couc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ywsYYlCBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Weighted Blanket: Yescool striped sherpa weighted blanket is made of 220gsm flannel with newest ribbed stripes. Layered texture offers a smooth velvety touch with ultimate gentleness and warmth. 200gsm Sherpa reverse is super fluffy and cloud-soft with multiple levels of cozy softness. Sleeping and napping in its snuggles gives a breezy feel like in the gentlest embraces. Advance 7-layers Design: Yescool Weighted Blanket has special glass beads filling process. High-density particles are used for filling, and the sewing craftsmanship is extremely particular. Glass beads have no strange smell and are safe. And don't worry about the beads leaking. Your skin will be surrounded by a gentle touch, giving you enough sense of security. Right Weight And Size: If you are the first time to use weighted blanket, it would be best to choose the weight 8%-10% of your body weight. And it’s necessary to spend days to get used to it. And attention, the weighted blanket which over 12 pounds is suitable for adults, not for kids. Our 48x72 inches sherpa weighted blanket is the same size as twin size bed, 60x80 inches is the same size as queen size bed. Sweet Sleep Companion: Our Sherpa weighted blanket with the perfect amount of pressure evenly helps you feel sure and reliable, calm your nerves, and induce quiet sleep, so you will drift off in deep and restful sleep and wake up full of spirit in the morning. The blanket offers hug-like comfort to make you feel warm, cozy and comfortable. It’s also a wonderful gift idea for lovers, family, and friends. Suitable for Valentine's Day, Father's Day, Mother's Day, Christmas. Way To Wash And Care: The blankets over 12 lbs are recommended to be washed in commercial washing machine. Washing with cold water, gentle mode and drying with a low temperature, all this factors take great contributions to refresh the weighted blanket. Pay attention to this factors you will always get it like a new one.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ywsYYlCBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"yescool","source_asin":"B0B5XWW3QW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-284230","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5XWW3QW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5XWW3QW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
