window.products.push({"id":284377,"name":"ZENG Knife Set with Block, 15 pcs Kitchen Knife Set, Chef Knife Set with Knife Sharpener, Stainless Steel Japanese Knife Set with Block Ultra Sharp, K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OlRO4OHbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Kitchen Knife Set Includes: 1*8\" chef's knife, 1* bread knife, 1* slicing knife, 1* santoku knife, 1* 6\" chef's knife, 1* utility knife, 1* paring knife, 1* knife sharpener, 1* kitchen scissors, 1* wooden block, 6* steak knife HC Stainless Steel: The chef knife set blade is made of high quality German stainless steel with 16-18% chromium content and 0.6-0.75% carbon content. Chef's knives have a smooth and glossy finish that will maintain their functionality for a long time. Vacuum heat treatment makes the blade hardness of the knife set reach HRC60±2, so the blade is indestructible and will not be broken after long-term use Ergonomic Pakka Handle: This material is known for its comfort, strength and stability. Professional and minimizes any fatigue, finger numbness or pain after holding the handle for extended periods of time continuously. Tips for the maintenance: the knife seat is made of brown walnut wood, with an elegant appearance design, it is a professional kitchen knife set. The knife holder has holes in the bottom to help with drainage, and the knives can be cleaned in the dishwasher, but high heat and dishwashing liquid can reduce sharpness. Satisfied Customer Service: ZENG focuses on developing high-quality knives, we promise to provide lifetime warranty service, you can buy and use with confidence. This professional kitchen knife set with stand is a great choice as a gift for Thanksgiving, Christmas, Father's Day, Mother's Day, Weddings, Birthdays and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OlRO4OHbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZENG","source_asin":"B0B1DC5DL7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-284377","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1DC5DL7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1DC5DL7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":284378,"name":"Yankee Candle Line-Dried Cotton Small Jar Candle, Fresh Scent","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4183XbHza4L._AC_.jpg","description":"A clean laundered fragrance mixed with a note of dewiness and a light floral breeze--the fresh scent of cotton drying in the sunlight.Fragrance Notes:Top: Mandarin, Lemon, MelonMid: Water Lily, Water Accord, LavenderBase: Cedarwood, MuskTop note is the initial impression of the fragrance, middle note is the main body of the scent and base is its final impression. About Small Classic Jar Candles: This little 3.7-oz gem is a good pick for sampling fragrances. Although it's small, trust us--the fragrance is still big. Each is made right here in America with premium-grade paraffin of the finest quality ingredients from around the world. Fun fact--we select the perfect wick type for each specific fragrance to ensure the very best quality burn. Who knew? (20-30 hours burn time).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4183XbHza4L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yankee Candle","source_asin":"B01AL6DR1Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-284378","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AL6DR1Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AL6DR1Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
