window.products.push({"id":284412,"name":"Farmhouse Room Decor Basket- Set of 3 Wall Hanging Seagrass Shallow Basket - Handwoven Southwestern Decorative Tobacco Baskets (Drawing pattern)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MDHnlOrIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RUSTIC WALL DECOR ACCENTS - This tray basket is a creative and charming addition to your wall decor collections. Thanks to its beautiful woven patterns and unique color mixture, the tray falls in harmony with many styles of decor, adding a nice touch of natural beauty to your home. This wire basket is a great choice for fireplace decor, master bedroom, living room or kitchen decor. VERSATILE SERVING TRAY - Made Terra wicker woven round serving tray for coffee table, bar, bread, snacks, food, drink, kitchen. It is easy to clean with wet cloth and is free from mold so long as it is kept in airy storage. It makes a perfect decorative tray for round coffee table or, with a little bit of flower decor and some scented candles, the tray becomes an attractive centerpiece for party table. GOOD FOR HOME - Meticulously made to details, MadeTerra seagrass round tray set is free from harmful chemicals, odor or splinters. The colors are lively and vivid, the weaving patterns are flawless. It is an item of premium craftsmanship and natural sound, made to last and benefit your sustainable home for a long time. GOOD FOR MOTHER EARTH - Made Terra wicker trays are made of seagrass, a plant that’s sustainably grown and easy to harvest. For thousands of years, seagrass is widely used by Vietnamese artisans to make home furniture and accessories. This is a great eco-friendly and sustainable decor and table serving solution. HANDCRAFTED BY LOCAL ARTISANS - Our seagrass woven round basket, just as every item sold under the brand name of MadeTerra, is handcrafted by the very hands of skilled artisans in Kim Son,the base of sedge and seagrass in Vietnam. All of our products are handmade, so the actual pieces may vary slightly in color and size from the images shown online.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MDHnlOrIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MadeTerra","source_asin":"B0999D11DF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-284412","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0999D11DF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0999D11DF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
