window.products.push({"id":284457,"name":"Bush Furniture Key West 2 Drawer Lateral File Cabinet in Washed Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":178.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZjSuHDCkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgrade your home office with the Key West 2 Drawer Lateral File Cabinet, the perfect storage solution for those who love coastal and farmhouse styling. With smooth full-extension ball bearing slides, the lateral filing cabinet's two spacious drawers make it effortless to access your letter, legal, and A4-size paperwork. The cabinet's unique X pattern accents and post leg design convey a relaxed appearance, giving it an easy-going charm that complements any casual home office style. Available in several attractive finishes, choose the perfect look for your space and take advantage of the array of coordinating Key West products, including office chairs, computer desks, accent cabinets, bookcases, and more (sold separately). Our file drawer is an ideal storage solution for keeping your home office organized and clutter-free. The cabinet's drawers open smoothly and effortlessly, ensuring you can access your paperwork quickly and easily. The Key West 2 Drawer Lateral File Cabinet's solid construction is built to last, and each drawer can hold letter, legal, and A4-size documents weighing up to 50 pounds. At Bush Furniture, we take pride in our 60-year legacy of being a leading manufacturer of ready-to-assemble furniture. Our growing collection of unique designs is made to fit every room and any budget, ensuring that you can outfit your living space with safe, stylish solutions. Trust us to provide you with high-quality home furnishings at an exceptional value. Choose the Key West 2 Drawer Lateral File Cabinet and add a touch of coastal charm to your home office. Don't forget to explore the coordinating Key West Collection to keep the modern farmhouse style throughout your entire home. Shop now and experience the perfect blend of style and function with our office lateral file cabinets and file cabinets for home office.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZjSuHDCkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bush Furniture","source_asin":"B01IXFGJHQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-284457","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IXFGJHQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IXFGJHQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
