window.products.push({"id":284459,"name":"Datsusara Vanguard Chopsticks Stainless Steel and Ebony Blackwood Reusable Portable Unique Chopstix with Carrying Case","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513Sd5BowGL._AC_SL1084_.jpg","description":"Be impressively prepared with your travel Vanguard Chopsticks from Datsusara. No longer suffer the horrors of evil splinter bearing, tree wasting disposable chopsticks! Our reusable chopsticks with carrying case are the ultimate utensil solution for the cultured, wise adventurer.  The wood tips are made from East African Blackwood (a.k.a. ebony), this wood is extremely durable and combined with the stainless steel grips we expect these to last a lifetime. These are also easy to carry in your bag or pocket as the tips unscrew and fit inside the grips for easy storage (like a fancy pool cue). Included is a nice hemp canvas case for easy storage. Laser etched \"DATSUSARA\" and Japanese Mon (crest) representing Hemp What Our Customers Are Saying: \"I love these as soon as they arrived i got some thai take away so i could try em out and they just work great so simple but effective and so much better than the disposable ones\". Grips: Stainless Steel Tips: East African Blackwood Case: 100% Hemp canvas Size: Stowed in case size: 5x1.6x.4\" Extended chopsticks size: 8.2x.4x.4\"  Weight: Chopsticks 1oz (28g), Case 1oz (28g) For you informed souls we want you to know that although this type of ebony is not an endangered species yet we realize that the demand for dark hardwoods is a growing problem. We will be donating a significant portion from the sales of these chopsticks to an organization that helps educate the public about ebony while replanting and maintaining the population of these amazing trees.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513Sd5BowGL._AC_SL1084_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Datsusara","source_asin":"B07W52K7PS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-284459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W52K7PS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W52K7PS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
