window.products.push({"id":284474,"name":"Zulay 2 Pack (9\"x12\") Silicone Trivets for Hot Pots and Pans - Multi-Purpose & Versatile Trivet Mat - Heat Resistant Silicone Trivet - Durable & Flexi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71izappGaWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Great For Countertops & Hot Items: Lessen your everyday kitchen struggles with these nifty and convenient mats. The Zulay Silicone Pot Mat is specially designed to make your life comfortable when you’re busy in the kitchen. Made of BPA Free 100% Silicone, it can withstand cold and hot temperatures from -40 to 480F. Designed with waterproof, non-slip pads to prevent slips. Its durable and reliable design helps protect your countertops from hot pots, pans, drips, and spills! Comes in a 2 pack. Versatile & Multipurpose Mats: Hot pots and pans always need a space to go especially when your stovetop is overwhelmed with cookware - and a good trivet mat is the best idea to help with that. It’s super versatile and multipurpose. You can use them as mitts to protect your hands when holding hot pans, for opening tight jars, as drip-proof spoon rest, or even as a coaster for other kitchen utensils! Valued Kitchen Essential: Never worry about your hot casserole skidding off your table or countertop as this silicone pot mat is constructed with non-slip pads, therefore, lessening accidents in the kitchen. Its 12-inch x 9-inch x 0.47-inch rectangular wavy stripe design is great for any surface or kitchen station to catch any oil splashes and spills, cater long casserole pans, or hold hot cookware during baking and cooking! Easy To Clean & Maintain: These silicone mats are waterproof, plus stain and odor resistant. These kitchen essentials are safe to pop in the dishwasher. They can also be cleaned by a quick hand wash by using a microfiber cloth and soap, let it air dry and you are good to go! Experience a more relaxing and stress-free kitchen environment with these pot mats. No Hassle, Zulay Guarantee: We love and take pride in our Silicone Pot Mats and we back this up with a lifetime guarantee. Have the confidence that this product will last, if there are ever any issues, just contact us and we will make it right. Order now and be assured that this product will live up to your expectations, guaranteed. If it does not, we got you covered. Chances are, you will never need to reach out!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71izappGaWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zulay Kitchen","source_asin":"B0BRNX2MRP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-284474","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRNX2MRP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRNX2MRP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
