window.products.push({"id":284573,"name":"SGI 100% Egyptian Cotton 600 TC Sheet Set Soft & Smooth Sateen Weave 4 Pc Sheet Set - 1 Fitted Sheet, 1 Flat Sheet & 2 Pillowcase 15\" inch Deep Pocket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fzKQohKdL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"COMPLETE 4-PIECE RV KING (72\"x80\") COTTON BED SHEET SET - Includes 1 fitted sheet, 1 flat sheet and 2 envelope-style pillowcases. The pillowcases and flat sheet feature quality sewn double-stitched seams to ensure long-lasting durability and easy care with cold water washing, while offering a sensuous feel that grows luxuriously softer with every wash. EXTRA DEEP POCKET WITH ALL-AROUND ELASTIC FOR A SNUG FIT: Indulge in the luxurious feel of our 4 Piece RV king sheet set which includes 1 flat sheet (102\" W x 108\" L), 1 fitted sheet (72\" W x 80\" L + 15\" deep pocket) and 2 Standard pillowcases (20\" W x 40\" L). The elasticized bottom sheet has a sizable deep pocket, making it perfect for both tall and pillow-top mattresses. Pull, tuck, and relax - its snug fit ensures the bed sheet stays intact while you enjoy a deep slumber. PURE COTTON BEDSHEET: If you love the feel of luxurious hotel sheets and crisp pillowcases, you'll adore our 600 thread count 100% cotton sheets. We use fine yarns made with long staple cotton fiber and a gorgeous sateen weave. Our sheets get softer with each wash, lifetime softness, and resist fading. Premium cotton yarns ensure sheets of the utmost comfort with detailed hem styling. EASY CARE - This ultra-soft sheet is very easy to maintain. Machine wash in cold water, do not bleach, Tumble dry low, if needed, and Wash dark colors separately. We manufacture these sheets without using any dyes which keeps the sheets bright-toned even after prolonged use. IDEAL GIFT & BRILLIANT ADDITION TO YOUR HOME LINENS: Feel the luxurious texture of a higher thread count sheet with our 600 thread count hotel-style bed set. The use of quality dyes gives all our bed sheets a brilliant color that complements every room’s decor. Its elegant look and lustrous shine offer the feel of royale bedding, making it the best gift choice for all your loved ones - mother, father, husband, wife, or kids.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fzKQohKdL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SGI bedding","source_asin":"B0C4TRGWWL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-284573","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4TRGWWL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4TRGWWL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
