window.products.push({"id":284704,"name":"US Art Frames 16x25 Black 1 Inch, Nugget Solid Poplar Hardwood Picture Poster Frame","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715UeYav+3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is a brand new picture, photo, diploma, poster frame. This designer frame is a unique frame that you will not find in most frame shops. Re-live your golden memories by decorating your home with photographs. The frame is perfect to lighten up your most cherished picture, photo, art gallery, poster, photograph, painting, diploma or artwork, yet modest enough to match just about any environment. Bright colors and artistic make, give these frames a vibrant and modish touch to the plain walls of your room. Give a personalized touch to your gifts by picking one of these frames. A one stop-shop for home décor. This frame is the perfect gift for a family member or friend! U.S. Art was founded in August 1997, and since inception, the company's focus has been to provide vibrant, diverse and rich artwork for our customers. In the early 2000's we at U.S. Art were not satisfied by the artwork available for framing so we started to develop and publish artwork. Today we have more than 250 original works of art that are exclusively published by us. U.S. Art's focus remains to enrich and strive for excellence, in developing publishing and framing. If you have any questions or comments, please do not hesitate to contact us. Feel free to visit our storefront and seller info pages to browse our extensive selection of frames, read customer feedback or review our policies and contact info. At the end of the day we want you to be completely happy with your purchase. Be sure to add us to your list of favorites so you can easily find us the next time you need a quality picture frame. Thank you for shopping with us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715UeYav+3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"US Art","source_asin":"B00819S4FK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-284704","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00819S4FK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00819S4FK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":284705,"name":"Novogratz 2019427N Vintage Mix Sofa Futon, Premium Linen Upholstery with Natural Wooden Legs Gold Finish, Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YGITN7IqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The unique design of the Novo Gratz Vintage Mix Futon allows it to effortlessly convert from a stylish, mid-century sofa to a bed. Its slim silhouette is upholstered in gray linen to offer a neutral tone that is elegant and refined. Details like natural wooden legs, wide track arms, tufted seat and back cushion help to make this sofa an original. It includes two (2) side bolster pillows in the same fabric to provide an overall vintage look.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YGITN7IqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Novogratz","source_asin":"B00ONJBZYO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-284705","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ONJBZYO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ONJBZYO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":284706,"name":"Bathroom Mirror - 36x36 Inch Bathroom Mirror,Modern Rounded Rectangle Mirror,Tempered Glass ShatterProof,Rustproof Vanity Mirror for Bathroom,Wall,Bed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hofsRw4vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High Definition Reflection】Bathroom Mirror adopts tempered mirrors to present clearer and truer high-definition images. The classic and simple modern style perfectly matches any interior decoration, suitable for bathroom, vanity, bedroom, living room, and dining room. Dimensions: 36\"x36\", Weight: 23.3lb. 【High-Quality Tempered Glass Mirror】JINHODY Bathroom Mirror is made of high-quality tempered glass, which is not easy to break. 4MM tempered glass is shatter-proof, explosion-proof and safe to use. Even if it is smashed by hard objects, it will not produce fragments, so you don't have to worry about safety issues, it is the first choice for families 【Durable Aluminum Alloy Frame】JINHODY Bathroom Mirror is made of an aluminum alloy frame design. The aluminum alloy frame adopts the straight-grained wire drawing process, which makes the metal frame full of luster and texture. Lighter than stainless steel. The anodizing process makes the metal frame waterproof and rustproof, durable and not deformed. Rounded corners can be protective and add elegance and design to bathrooms and rooms. 【SAFE AND EASY TO INSTALL】Bathroom Mirror can be installed vertically or horizontally. JINHODY Bathroom Mirror includes two Z-shaped wall brackets that can be mounted on the wall for hanging. Screw the wall bracket to the wall and hang the bathroom mirror on the bracket. The wall bracket is sturdy enough to support the weight of the mirror and ensure that the mirror rests more securely against the wall. Measure your space before punching to make sure it fits 【Reliable Packaging and Customer Service】The packaging of the JINHODY Bathroom Mirror is safe and reliable, the mirror is fixed in a carton with custom styrofoam and passed the drop test. We also offer lifetime customer service for our bathroom mirrors. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, we will reply you within 24 hours and spare no effort to solve the problem for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hofsRw4vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JINHODY","source_asin":"B0B7JFFTZK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-284706","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7JFFTZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7JFFTZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
