window.products.push({"id":284939,"name":"5 in 1 Handheld Immersion Blender, Anti-Splash Stick Blender with a Milk Frother, Egg Whisk, Food Grinder, and Blending Container, Hand Held Blender f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+D8tJ4NlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TAKE THE STRESS OUT OF COOKINGEmbrace the ConvenienceCooking can be amazing. The aromas. The tastes. The smiles on everyone’s face as they discover the deliciousness: it’s an experience to savor. An experience that tedious prepping always threatens to ruin … until now. Meet our 5-in-1 immersion hand blender: versatility that makes your time in the kitchen so much easier. Every set comes with a stick blender, milk frother, egg whisk, blending container, and a mini food processor. Simply attach the accessory you need, press a button, and watch this little gadget save you a great deal of time and elbow grease.Experience the DifferenceNot all immersion hand blenders are created equal. Some struggle to blend through coarser foods. Others cause a total mess. And most create an unbearable racket. We’ve done things differently. Thanks to a powerful 500W motor, our blender tackles the toughest of foods and leaves scrumptiousness in its wake. It’s also cleverly contoured to minimize splashes and has a quiet motor that keeps the racket at bay. Don’t settle for less. Invest in a handheld blender that gets the small things right.Here are more reasons to love this multifunctional blender:- Has 6 blades for faster, more efficient blending.- Made of strong, rust-resistant 304 stainless steel.- 100% BPA-free to keep both you & your family safe.- Features 6 speed settings and 2 modes to suit the task.- Easy to clean: simply rinse the accessories or use your dishwasher.- Great for smoothies, coffee, baby food, baking, vegetable chopping, and more.Go ahead, get your 5-in-1 immersion blender with the confidence of a lifetime warranty!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+D8tJ4NlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Asani","source_asin":"B09NYD3LH8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-284939","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NYD3LH8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NYD3LH8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
