window.products.push({"id":284960,"name":"2 Slice Toaster, Stainless Steel Toaster, Extra Wide Slots, 6 Shade Settings, Prime Rated Toasters with LED Display, Removable Crumb Tray, Defrost/Reh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CqMlqGrmL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【LED COUNTDOWN TIMER DISPLAY】: The bread toaster comes with a blue LED screen diaplay indicating toasting progress, making it easy to see the baking gear and the remaining time about selected shade setting at a glance. Note: 3 basic functions (defrost, reheat and cancel). Defrost mode plus 30 secs, reheat mode heat 30 secs on selected gear, and Cancel can stop toasting anytime. 【1.5\" EXTRA WIDE SLOTS】: LOFTER 2 Slice Toaster measures 1.5\" wide slots with adjusting guides, making it suitable for various bread types, such as thin waffles or thick artisanal bread,and always keep breads in best toasting position. It also equipped with automatic pop up function when the food done. 【6 BROWNING SETTINGS】: The Stainless Steel Toaster with 6 browning dials, enable you to decide the right degree of toasting, choosing from lightly golden to deep dark toasted slice from 1 (light) to 6 (dark) gear accommodated by individual preferences. heating wire on both sides of each slot toasts breads evenly and fast. enable you to decide the right degree of toasting for you. 【EASY TO CLEAN AND STORAGE】: Bread crumbs are collected in a removable tray at the bottom of the toaster, so just pull it out and clean the crumbs immediately(the tray can be washed directly)! It even has a fuss-free cord wrap underneath the toaster to manage unsightly power cords when finished using it. 【100% SAFETY & NO RISK】: Built with high-end and durable stainless steel and multi-hole design on the bottom, the toaster guarantees a faster cooling speed. The toaster not only provides an anti-overheat protection, but also upgrades anti-leakage protection, great increasing security when making breakfast. Purchase it now by click \"By now with 1-Click\"or\"Add to Cart\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CqMlqGrmL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOFTER","source_asin":"B07VVQWB85","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-284960","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VVQWB85","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VVQWB85","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
